 629:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @brief  USART Disable (all USART prescalers and outputs are disabled)
 630:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @note   When USART is disabled, USART prescalers and outputs are stopped immediately,
 631:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         and current operations are discarded. The configuration of the USART is kept, but all t
 632:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         flags, in the USARTx_ISR are set to their default values.
