1980:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @rmtoll RTOR         BLEN          LL_USART_SetBlockLength
1981:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @param  USARTx USART Instance
1982:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @param  BlockLength Value between Min_Data=0x00 and Max_Data=0xFF
