2036:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @brief  Indicate if IrDA mode is enabled
2037:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @note   Macro IS_IRDA_INSTANCE(USARTx) can be used to check whether or not
2038:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         IrDA feature is supported by the USARTx instance.
2039:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @rmtoll CR3          IREN          LL_USART_IsEnabledIrda
