2096:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         to achieve the Irda Low Power frequency (8 bits value)
2097:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @note   Macro IS_IRDA_INSTANCE(USARTx) can be used to check whether or not
