2922:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @brief  Check if the USART Parity Error Flag is set or not
2923:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @rmtoll ISR          PE            LL_USART_IsActiveFlag_PE
